cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NEPHELE in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NEPHELE: Networked Ensemble Plume-Hazard Estimation & Lagrangian Engine"
abstract: >-
  Real-time Lagrangian stochastic CBRN dispersion modelling in urban canopies,
  with online data assimilation (Ensemble Kalman / particle filtering) and
  information-optimal sensor-network placement.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/pier-car/montecarlo_project"
keywords:
  - CBRN
  - atmospheric dispersion
  - Lagrangian stochastic model
  - Monte Carlo
  - data assimilation
  - ensemble Kalman filter
  - submodular optimization
  - sensor placement
authors:
  - name: "NEPHELE contributors"
